        "official_en_sha256": "2932ffbd655e67a44ce54df6bf5af69c4d43bd90072ebaf27e91f4a9417cb895"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "じゃ、借りを返すまで\r\n飛空艇に居候させてもらうわ。\r\n傭兵の仕事をしながらにはなるけどね。",
        "official_en": "Okay. In that case, I’ll tag along on your airship until I can pay you back—in between mercenary jobs, of course.",
        "real_en": null
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "KEEP"
      },
