        "official_en_sha256": "7f2e16329f780593c170783fcc82ba23f7a25d2d53f8c268b74987ed680ead22"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "そういうわけにもいかないでしょ。\r\n対価は正当に与えられないと。",
        "official_en": "That may be, but I still have to give you your fair share. Come on, fifty-fifty.",
        "real_en": "I can’t do that. You deserve to be paid fairly for your help."
